// Signing for archives (RD22). The base configuration of the project's Debug
// and Release configurations.
//
// The team is not in the repository, which is public. On the Mac that makes
// archives, create `Signing.local.xcconfig` next to this file (git-ignored)
// with one line:
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = <your Team ID>
//
// taken from developer.apple.com › Account › Membership details of the paid
// Apple Developer account. Never pick a team in Xcode's Signing & Capabilities
// pane: Xcode would write it into project.pbxproj, and
// `ios/Tools/check_release.py` fails on that.
//
// Without the local file (CI, any other Mac) nothing changes: builds that do
// not sign work as before.

#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
